Package: figma-font-bridge
Version: 4.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SIINBot <siinmedia@example.com>
Depends: nodejs (>= 16)
Description: Figma Font Helper for Linux — local fonts in Figma web
 A drop-in local font server that mimics Figma's official Font Helper
 protocol, so locally installed Linux fonts appear in Figma (browser).
 .
 Fully self-contained: dependencies are bundled (no npm install needed at
 setup). Implements /figma/version, /figma/font-files, /figma/font-file,
 listens on 127.0.0.1:44950 (plus fallback ports). Runs as a systemd user
 service that auto-starts on login. Works offline after install.
